  referendum:{definition:'A direct vote in which the electorate is asked to decide a specific question or proposal. Its subject, eligibility rules, and whether the result is binding or advisory depend on the legal system.',synonyms:['direct public vote','popular vote on a specific question'],example:{word:'referendum',text:'Voters took part in a referendum on the proposed constitutional change.'},exampleSynonym:{word:'direct public vote',text:'Voters took part in a direct public vote on the proposed constitutional change.'}},
