'rejoneador':{definition:'In bullfighting, a mounted bullfighter who uses a lance called a rejón to fight the bull.',synonyms:['mounted bullfighter','bullfighter on horseback'],example:{word:'rejoneador',text:'The rejoneador entered the arena on horseback and carried a rejón.'},exampleSynonym:{word:'mounted bullfighter',text:'The mounted bullfighter entered the arena on horseback and carried a rejón.'},translation:{es:'rejoneador; torero a caballo'}},
