"xenoglossy":{definition:"noun: an alleged ability to speak or write a language that the person has not learned; a term used in parapsychology for this claimed phenomenon.",synonyms:["xenoglossia"],example:{word:"xenoglossy",text:"The report treats xenoglossy as an unverified parapsychological claim."},exampleSynonym:{word:"xenoglossia",text:"The report treats xenoglossia as an unverified parapsychological claim."},translation:{es:"xenoglosia; supuesta capacidad de usar una lengua no aprendida"}},
